{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門人了如等述錄教義宗乘各百偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中因果乃聖\n\n位中修證之圓因妙果，非善惡因果之謂也，後皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂理法界，事法界，理事無礙法界，事事無礙法界也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即前信、住、行、向、地、等妙二覺也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普天之下，從古至今，曾無一人逃得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出息雖存，入息難保，一息不來，即為後世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一念之差，便墮惡趣。得人身如爪上土，失人身者如大地土"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三途一報五千劫，再出頭來是幾時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此日月輪可令墮落，妙高山王可使傾動，諸佛所言無有異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如今娑婆無異，的的現有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "己今當願，己今當生，經有明文，豈欺我哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "境勝緣強，退心不起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壽命無量，何事不辦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唯心有具、造二義。如上諸法，皆我心具，皆我心造"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0332001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0332001", "type": "orig", "text": "目錄新作"}
